Component
---------

    Bootstrap Icons — the icon font stylesheet. The font binaries
    (bootstrap-icons.woff / .woff2) are served by the deck at runtime from
    the `/mod/bootstrap/fonts/` asset route; this directory holds only the
    CSS that names them.

    Upstream: https://icons.getbootstrap.com/   (source: https://github.com/twbs/icons)
    File:     ./bootstrap-icons.css

